<title>USA: PLC seeks stock halt Mon, awaiting FDA.</title>
<headline>PLC seeks stock halt Mon, awaiting FDA.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKLIN, Mass. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PLC Systems Inc said Friday that it has asked the American Stock Exchange to halt trading of its common stock on July 28, pending a decision by an advisory panel to the Food and Drug Administration regarding the approval for marketing of its Heart Laser TMR System.</p>
<p>The advisory panel is meeting on July 28 and is expected to issue its recommendation that day.</p>
<p>PLC Systems develops medical systems and technology designed to provide patients suffering from coronary artery disease a third alternative or adjunct to angioplasty and cardiac bypass surgery.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
